---
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import PortalPreview from '../components/PortalPreview.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="North Alabama Renovation, Reimagined" description="A new chapter for your North Alabama property. Explore whole-home renovations, kitchens, bathrooms, and investment property improvements with Apex. Start your project." dark>
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-image-wrap"><picture><source media="(max-width: 650px)" srcset="/assets/hero-concept-mobile.webp" /><img class="hero-image" src="/assets/hero-concept.webp" alt="Concept of a warmly illuminated renovated brick home with an oak entry and bronze-framed windows" width="1400" height="934" fetchpriority="high" data-parallax /></picture></div>
    <div class="hero-shade"></div>
    <div class="hero-architect-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow hero-line"><span class="gold-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Property renovation · North Alabama</span>
        <h1 id="hero-title"><span class="hero-line">Property.</span><span class="hero-line">Potential.</span><span class="hero-line text-metallic">Realized.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-line">Thoughtfully transformed spaces.<br />A renovation experience built around you.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions hero-line"><a href="/start-your-project/" class="button button-gold">Let’s talk about your property <span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-bottom"><a href="#possibilities" class="scroll-cue"><span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-down" /></span> Discover the possibilities</a><div class="hero-image-label"><span>THE NEXT CHAPTER</span><span>Architectural concept / 01</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="promise-rail" aria-label="The Apex approach"><span>Considered spaces</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Clearly defined scope</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>A connected client experience</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>North Alabama, reimagined</span></div>
  <section class="section services-section" id="possibilities">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-intro"><span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>01 / The possibilities</span><div data-reveal><h2>Not just a renovation.<br />A new way to <span class="text-muted">live in it.</span></h2><p>From the room that never quite worked to a property ready for a complete rethink. We start with your vision, then bring the moving pieces into focus.</p></div></div>
      <div class="service-showcase">
        <div class="service-visual" data-reveal>
          <img data-service-image="home" class="active" src="/assets/living-concept.webp" alt="Whole-home living room design concept with an oak beam and limestone fireplace" width="900" height="850" loading="lazy" />
          <img data-service-image="rooms" src="/assets/kitchen-concept.webp" alt="Kitchen renovation concept with oak cabinetry and a limestone island" width="900" height="850" loading="lazy" />
          <img data-service-image="investment" src="/assets/investment-concept.webp" alt="Investment property exterior renovation concept" width="900" height="850" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="image-note">Design concepts</span>
        </div>
        <div class="service-list" data-reveal>
          <a href="/renovations/whole-home/" class="service-row service-active" data-service-row="home"><span class="service-number">01</span><div><h3>Whole-home<br /> renovations</h3><p>Bring the entire property into its next chapter.</p></div><span class="circle-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></a>
          <a href="/renovations/kitchens-bathrooms/" class="service-row" data-service-row="rooms"><span class="service-number">02</span><div><h3>Kitchens &<br /> bathrooms</h3><p>Make everyday spaces feel anything but ordinary.</p></div><span class="circle-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></a>
          <a href="/renovations/investment-properties/" class="service-row" data-service-row="investment"><span class="service-number">03</span><div><h3>Investment<br /> properties</h3><p>Thoughtful improvements. A more organized process.</p></div><span class="circle-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="architecture-section section-dark" data-architecture aria-labelledby="architecture-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="architecture-top"><div data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">02 / A different perspective</span><h2 id="architecture-title">Every great space<br />starts with <span class="text-metallic">possibility.</span></h2></div><p data-reveal>Go beneath the surface. Explore a home, open up the plan, and see how the pieces come together.</p></div>
      <div class="architecture-viewer">
        <div class="viewer-topline"><span class="eyebrow">APEX / SPATIAL EXPLORER</span><button type="button" class="viewer-reset" data-architecture-reset>Reset view <span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="rotate-left" /></span></button></div>
        <div data-architecture-canvas><img class="architecture-fallback" src="/assets/living-concept.webp" alt="Architectural interior concept. Use the stage controls to explore the idea." width="1400" height="934" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="viewer-bottomline"><span><span class="gold-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Interactive architectural concept</span><span class="drag-hint">Drag to rotate <span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="move-horizontal" /></span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="architecture-controls" role="group" aria-label="Architectural concept stages">
        <button type="button" data-architecture-stage="0" aria-pressed="true"><span>01</span><strong>See the potential</strong><span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-architecture-stage="1" aria-pressed="false"><span>02</span><strong>Open the possibilities</strong><span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></button>
        <button type="button" data-architecture-stage="2" aria-pressed="false"><span>03</span><strong>Bring it together</strong><span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="architecture-caption"><p data-architecture-caption aria-live="polite">Explore the spaces and structure of a complete architectural concept.</p><span>Illustrative model, not a completed Apex project.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section portal-section">
    <div class="wrap portal-section-grid">
      <div class="portal-section-copy" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">03 / The Apex difference</span><h2>Love the result.<br /><span class="text-muted">Know the process.</span></h2><p>A great renovation should not leave you guessing. Your Apex client portal brings the work plan, project photos, schedule, and important documents into one private place.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Your property. Your own workspace.</li><li>Progress you can follow.</li><li>The right people, with the right access.</li></ul><a href="/experience/" class="text-link">Explore the Apex experience <span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></a></div>
      <PortalPreview />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="process-section section">
    <div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">04 / From first idea to next chapter</span><h2>A clear path forward.</h2><p>You don’t need all the answers before we talk. Just a property and a sense of what could be better.</p></div><div class="process-grid">
      <div data-reveal><span class="process-number">01<span></span></span><h3>Tell us what’s possible.</h3><p>Share the property, your priorities, and the changes you have in mind.</p></div>
      <div data-reveal><span class="process-number">02<span></span></span><h3>Bring the plan into focus.</h3><p>Discuss the site, scope, selections, and what needs to happen before work starts.</p></div>
      <div data-reveal><span class="process-number">03<span></span></span><h3>Stay connected to the work.</h3><p>Follow your project in a dedicated portal as its next chapter takes shape.</p></div>
    </div><a href="/start-your-project/" class="button button-dark">Start with a conversation <span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section faq-section"><div class="wrap split-content"><div data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">A few things worth knowing</span><h2>Big ideas.<br />Straight answers.</h2></div><div class="faq-list" data-reveal>
    <details><summary>Where does Apex work?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>We serve North Alabama. Include your city and a little about the property in your inquiry so we can discuss the location and scope together.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Do I need a finished design to get started?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. Share what is not working, what you want to change, and any ideas or priorities you already have. The first conversation helps identify what information the project needs next.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How much will my renovation cost?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>That depends on the property, its existing condition, the scope, and your selections. We discuss those details before proposing a project-specific scope. There is no automatic estimate or commitment when you submit the form.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can I follow the project without being on site?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>The Apex portal gives authorized clients a private place to view recorded progress, photos, work plans, and project documents. Project access stays separate, even when you have more than one property.</p></details>
  </div></div></section>
  <CTA />
</SiteLayout>
